                            rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1935, vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">i</hi>, p. 541</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d159-f4" n="4" xml:id="d159-f4-content">
                <p>Belgian counterdraft not printed.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
